og values for sample pairs.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t5-ehp-116-1533" position="float"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>Factors affecting recontamination.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">All containers</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Recontaminated</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Treated</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Large mouth</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Uncovered</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="6" align="left" rowspan="1">Enterococci</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;<italic>n</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">158</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">74</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">37</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">42</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">119</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Slope</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.11</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.51</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.05</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.40</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.13</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(&#x02212;0.06 to 0.27)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(0.28 to 0.74)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(&#x02212;0.40 to 0.51)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(0.16 to 0.63)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(&#x02212;0.15 to 0.21)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;OR</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.27</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10.7<xref